                        "glosses": [
                            "In Ancient Greece, an arrangement whereby a citizen (chosen by the city) hosted foreign ambassadors at his own expense, in return for honorary titles from the state."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
